   | `package.json` with `scripts.test` | `pnpm test` / `yarn test` / `bun run test` / `npm test`, chosen by lockfile |
   | `Cargo.toml` | `cargo test` |
   | `pyproject.toml`, `pytest.ini`, `setup.cfg` | `uv run pytest` if `uv.lock` exists, else `pytest` |
